[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-boston-consulting-group-bcg-graduate-analyst-program-2026-how-to-apply-228":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},228,"boston-consulting-group-bcg-graduate-analyst-program-2026-how-to-apply-228","Boston Consulting Group (bcg) Graduate Analyst Program 2026: How To Apply","\u003Cp>Apply now for an internship or a full-time consulting position. We are actively hiring consultants from a wide range of industries and backgrounds. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>BCG Graduate Analyst Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Boston Consulting Group\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Salary\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>On-the-job Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>BCG Graduate Analyst Program Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Graduate Analyst Programme (GAP) is ideal for outstanding graduates and early career starters who are interested in discovering a career path within strategy consulting.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>A GAP year at BCG will provide you with on-the-job exposure and best-in-class training from our BCG network.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>BCG has a proud heritage of working in Nigeria, dating back to 2016. Today, we have the most significant footprint of any premium consulting firm and continue to experience substantial growth.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While each office retains its distinctive character, the system as a whole is a popular destination because of its can-do, laid-back culture. BCG houses \u003Cstrong>Consultants, Project Leaders, Product Managers, Engineers, Designers, Marketers\u003C\u002Fstrong>, and more.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Boston Consulting Group Graduate Analyst Program Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Boston Consulting Group Graduate Analyst Program offers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>medical, dental and vision coverage,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>telemedicine services,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>life, accident and disability insurance,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>parental leave and family planning benefits,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>caregiving resources, mental health offerings,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>a generous retirement program,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>financial guidance, paid time off, and more.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>BCG Graduate Trainee Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the BCG Graduate Analyst Program, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>BCG Associate:\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Cbr \u002F>​​​​​​​To join BCG team as an associate or senior associate, you need to have the following: \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Excellent academic results from a recognized university i.e. second class upper and above.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Preferably completed, or completing a masters or PhD degree.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>We equally value candidates with an impressive record of relevant working experience. For associates, we require 3+ years of working experience and 5+ years for senior associates.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Boston Consulting Group Graduate Analyst Program\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the BCG Graduate Analyst Program, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill the online application form. You will need to submit the following:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Your r​​esume.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>High school transcripts i.e. Ordinary or Advanced Level certificates.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>All university transcripts.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Get Invite to complete an online case experience.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Invite for the rounds of interview\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcareers.bcg.com\u002Fglobal\u002Fen\u002Flocations\u002Fnigeria\">https:\u002F\u002Fcareers.bcg.com\u002Fglobal\u002Fen\u002Flocations\u002Fnigeria\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-11 13:00:00",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fboston-consulting-group-bcg-graduate-analyst-program-2026-how-to-apply\u002F6a01c4c0d6a479.10670181_screenshot 2026-05-11 125304.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u0